{"id": "1485018346167468103", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "1369272547429842944", "author_name": "hype06200", "content": "hi guys, im pretty new so i have a couple of questions to ask, i hope thats fine\n- with the characters that i have, do these two teams work ?\n- is there a specific standard/standard copy that i should use my protoparadise on ?\n- is there a specific standard WoD i should be claiming ?\n- should i reroll ? im only at chapter 4. I took GHelot/Horla/Hameln/Tawil as my choice banner thing \nid appreciate any advice thanks chat", "timestamp": "2026-03-21T20:52:44.033000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1485018344649392258", "filename": "IMG_4865.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 170480, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1400749543288475770/1485018344649392258/IMG_4865.jpg?ex=6ac213db&is=6ac0c25b&hm=40e9bb5e04aeccddc29cb8da472ab8159b57fda6b208334dc6c77e8699d66a99&"}, {"id": "1485018345186132211", "filename": "IMG_4866.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 167489, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1400749543288475770/1485018345186132211/IMG_4866.jpg?ex=6ac213db&is=6ac0c25b&hm=0da1529ac47a47dd49d53e1f230f9cc89eff9f6863cee2563007eee6765fb0f7&"}, {"id": "1485018345534132394", "filename": "IMG_4867.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 156614, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1400749543288475770/1485018345534132394/IMG_4867.jpg?ex=6ac213db&is=6ac0c25b&hm=d03aad6f9d4dfd7b86bd8144383ffe5d1d536d21abd705df8c4cc9df9f6fdfd3&"}, {"id": "1485018345916072046", "filename": "IMG_4868.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 136294, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1400749543288475770/1485018345916072046/IMG_4868.jpg?ex=6ac213db&is=6ac0c25b&hm=2d30b2c212387ec17c6edd926a306598cddc7d0cb276c180fab8e56bc849db15&"}]}
{"id": "1485020743053086842", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "769372452580229131", "author_name": "kinbote.", "content": "Teams look generally fine. I would recommend using either helot (as an exalt support, she boots helot catena's strikes) or agrippa in the 4th slot of the second team over leigh. Ghelot will be a struggle early game due to your team's max hp and leigh will make that problem worse. I think leighs a reasonable consideration late game though.\n\nYour teams look fine for now. Would recommend saving your protos when you are trying to build your 4th/5th teams for dtide.\n\nFor standard wods you should roll for titans blade until it is +12. Majority of the dps in the game really like having it (like helot catena).\n\nDon't think you need to reroll. Vortice is pretty strong early on and horla is one of the strongest supports in the game.", "timestamp": "2026-03-21T21:02:15.495000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["1369272547429842944"], "reply_to": "1485018346167468103"}
